phosh-first-boot 0.3.0
----------------------
Released November 2026
* New panel for setting the hostname
* user panel:
    * Add duplicate user check
    * Lock root account
* Issues fixed:
    * https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phosh-first-boot/-/work_items/7
    * https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phosh-first-boot/-/work_items/8
* Contributors:
    * Alexander Martinz
    * Guido Günther

phosh-first-boot 0.2.0
----------------------
Released October 2026
* user panel:
  * Allow to configure minimum password and username length
  * Add user to sudo group by default
  * Use homed's LUKS backend by default
  * Mark more strings as translatable
* Various fixes to build on Fedora too
* Issues fixed:
    * https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phosh-first-boot/-/work_items/3
* Contributors:
    * Alexander Martinz
    * Guido Günther
    * Sam Day

phosh-first-boot 0.1.1
----------------------
Released August 2026
* user panel: Allow to add auxiliary groups. This can be configured
  by the distribution.
* Issues fixed:
    * https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/phosh-first-boot/-/work_items/5
* Contributors:
    * Guido Günther

